### **2. Reader, Processor, and Writer Implementation**

#### **Reader Implementation**
A simple `ItemReader` implementation:

```java
package com.example.batchProj.operation;

import org.springframework.batch.item.ItemReader;
import org.springframework.stereotype.Component;

@Component("chunkReader")
public class ChunkReader implements ItemReader<String> {

    private final String[] data = {"Item1", "Item2", "Item3", "Item4"};
    private int index = 0;

    @Override
    public String read() {
        if (index < data.length) {
            return data[index++];
        } else {
            return null; // Indicates end of data
        }
    }
}
```

