#### **Processor Implementation**
A simple `ItemProcessor` to process the data:

```java
package com.example.batchProj.operation;

import org.springframework.batch.item.ItemProcessor;
import org.springframework.stereotype.Component;

@Component("chunkProcessor")
public class ChunkProcessor implements ItemProcessor<String, String> {

    @Override
    public String process(String item) {
        return item.toUpperCase(); // Process data by converting to uppercase
    }
}
```

